@model Fanex.Affiliate.User.Core.MetalModels.Email.EmailSignUpParam

<table>
    <tr>
        <td>
            <p style="color: #313131; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5">
                Dear @Model.User.FirstName,<br /><br />

                We are writing to let you know that we have received your application to become a 12BET affiliate. Our team is currently reviewing your application and we appreciate your interest in working with us.<br /><br />

                At 12BET, we are always on the lookout for talented and dedicated affiliates to join our program. We are dedicated to providing our affiliates with the support and resources they need to succeed, and we believe that working together is the key for a profitable partnership.<br /><br />

                It may take up to 3 business days to review your application, please be assured that we will take the time to carefully consider all of the information you have provided.<br /><br />

                Our Affiliate Manager may try to get in touch with you at <strong>@Model.IMName: @Model.IMValue</strong> or on your provided contact number: <strong>@Model.UserNumberContact</strong> while reviewing your application. Do reply back and update us your contact details if the afore mentioned details are incorrect.<br /><br />

                Thank you for your patience and for considering 12BET as a potential partner.<br /><br />

                Best regards,<br /><br />
            </p>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
@Raw(Model.ContactInfo)